Interactive installer, updater, and manager for Prometheus-stack services:
Node Exporter, Prometheus, Grafana, and Pushgateway.

Options:
  -h, --help      Display this help menu and exit

Interactive Modes:
  Install         Downloads and configures a service from GitHub releases
  Update (u)      Upgrades an existing service while preserving data
  Recover (r)     Reverts a service to a previously installed backup version
  Delete (d)      Uninstalls the service, configurations, and system account

Examples:
  sudo ./minstaller.sh          Launch the interactive menu
  ./minstaller.sh --help        Show this help text
